  "selected_clauses": [
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 15.13,
      "end": 17.99,
      "text": "这条裤子整个的中心,它漂亮的一个精致的点,全部在这里。",
      "members": [
        7
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 171,
      "start": 372.61,
      "end": 374.25,
      "text": "就简简单单我们家最经典的裤形",
      "members": [
        171
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "scene",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 219,
      "start": 462.29,
      "end": 464.15,
      "text": "裤身非常宽松的小喇叭裤",
      "members": [
        219
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "scene",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 71.75,
      "end": 76.81,
      "text": "它是这样的一个VV的宽松的小指捅的小喇叭感的一个感觉一点都不夸张",
      "members": [
        34,
        35
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "scene",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 70.49,
      "end": 71.75,
      "text": "裤子一点都不肥",
      "members": [
        33
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "scene",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 208.85,
      "end": 211.29,
      "text": "我觉得这种裤型你们但凡穿过咱们家裤子的话",
      "members": [
        98
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 212.51,
      "end": 216.45,
      "text": "它的裤型是非常显腿直的特别有腿粗腿不直的女生",
      "members": [
        100,
        101
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 224.51,
      "end": 226.51,
      "text": "它可以很好地拉直你的小腿",
      "members": [
        107
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 471.57,
      "end": 472.75,
      "text": "还嫌你的腿特别的直",
      "members": [
        226
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 128.81,
      "end": 131.89,
      "text": "有小肚子适合不适合因为我们后面是松紧腰的",
      "members": [
        62,
        63
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 135.94,
      "end": 139.1,
      "text": "松紧腰的是穿着很舒服的裤腰看这里是有松紧的",
      "members": [
        65,
        66
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 529.31,
      "end": 531.41,
      "text": "假跨也能穿一点都不会嫌假跨",
      "members": [
        261,
        262
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 531.79,
      "end": 533.33,
      "text": "因为你看这里是有松亮的",
      "members": [
        263
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 86.65,
      "end": 88.51,
      "text": "而且裤子的话很精巧不挑人",
      "members": [
        41
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 504.95,
      "end": 506.55,
      "text": "离型身材特别合适",
      "members": [
        247
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 536.29,
      "end": 539.59,
      "text": "这种裤子是带有微微一点弹的一点都不会让你绷的难受",
      "members": [
        266,
        267
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 12.55,
      "end": 14.03,
      "text": "威弹力非常舒服,一点都不压人。",
      "members": [
        5
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 500.69,
      "end": 503.05,
      "text": "你们但凡觉得穿不了这种小脚裤的",
      "members": [
        245
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 222,
      "start": 466.23,
      "end": 467.61,
      "text": "它不会让你很紧很崩",
      "members": [
        222
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 221,
      "start": 465.19,
      "end": 466.23,
      "text": "你里面搭个秋裤都能穿",
      "members": [
        221
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 25.23,
      "end": 30.17,
      "text": "而且它的灭料是一件惊访的羊毛的料子很舒服这款的话是奥毛的魂放",
      "members": [
        11,
        12,
        13
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 192,
      "start": 420.27,
      "end": 423.01,
      "text": "裤子是秋冬的款了它不是薄的了随便去穿",
      "members": [
        192
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 194,
      "start": 424.49,
      "end": 425.93,
      "text": "然后它的克重是比较高的",
      "members": [
        194
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 197,
      "start": 427.97,
      "end": 430.01,
      "text": "都是给大家做的单层无符合",
      "members": [
        197
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 195,
      "start": 425.93,
      "end": 427.05,
      "text": "上身舒适度非常的高",
      "members": [
        195
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 30.17,
      "end": 32.55,
      "text": "然后我们又做了这样的一个小脚口的设计",
      "members": [
        14
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 211,
      "start": 449.55,
      "end": 451.21,
      "text": "裤子它的细节做得好好看",
      "members": [
        211
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "start": 280.17,
      "end": 285.99,
      "text": "不是是侧面拉链所以这个裤子很版正我告诉你超级的版正这里有口袋",
      "members": [
        125,
        126
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 215,
      "start": 457.21,
      "end": 460.11,
      "text": "很好的让一个黑色的裤子有增添一点点的设计感",
      "members": [
        215,
        216
      ],
      "group": 11,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 203,
      "start": 435.45,
      "end": 440.05,
      "text": "它的那种质感是让你肉眼可见一下子就感受到裤子很高级的很好看",
      "members": [
        203,
        204
      ],
      "group": 12,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 67.45,
      "end": 69.45,
      "text": "但是裤子你单看它板型宝宝",
      "members": [
        31
      ],
      "group": 13,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 493.67,
      "end": 495.07,
      "text": "我们家的裤型真的超级的整",
      "members": [
        241
      ],
      "group": 13,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 184,
      "start": 397.95,
